cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "LAMBclassifier: Luminal-Apocrine-Metaplastic-Basal Breast Cancer Classifier"
abstract: >-
  Assigns breast cancer expression profiles to six classes defined by position on
  the normal mammary differentiation hierarchy, using single-sample singscore rank
  enrichment over a fixed 13,468-gene universe. Works on bulk RNA-seq, single-cell
  cluster pseudobulk and spatial transcriptomics under one specification.
authors:
  - family-names: Ray
    given-names: Debjeet
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/debjeetrayx/LAMBclassifier"
keywords:
  - breast-cancer
  - transcriptomics
  - classification
  - spatial-transcriptomics
  - single-cell
